{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "d1_notes",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "notes-decisions",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 1040,
      "fill": "$bg-sidebar",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0001",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 20,
          "name": "标题",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1132,
          "content": "Issue #116 · D0-1 主 UI 设计契约",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0002",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 50,
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1132,
          "content": "sidebar-states.pen · v3.1 · 2026-11-03 · issue #116「满高壳 + 15% 比值地板的 PTY 局部避让 + fixed 状态栏触物理底 + 滚轮隔离」候选契约；设计评审前稿件，不是实施完成证明",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0003",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "01 · 满高壳 + 键盘覆盖：布局不动，终端三盒各自让位",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0004",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 118,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "满高壳 + 键盘覆盖：#app 恒满高（bottom = clientHeight = 702，inline height 恒为空）；整页钉 vv.height 已删除。\n15% 比值地板：raw = max(0, clientHeight − vv.height)；raw < clientHeight×0.15 → occlusion = 0（豁免），达到才全额付。\n702 布局地板 105.3px：274 → 宿主 428 / 控制列 448 / 状态栏 428；555 → 147 / 167 / 147 让位；633.5（68.5 = 9.8%）豁免 0。\n根不可滚：html/body 先 hidden 再 clip，#app 脱流 fixed；滚轮只 preventDefault 根默认，绝不 scrollLines。\n触底：#status-bar 由 absolute 改 fixed bottom:0；侧栏分隔线 1px（#sidebar::after）穿过 safe-area 到物理底。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0005",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 232,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "02 · 单一应用壳与固定主操作",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0006",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 260,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "保留 ≤768 drawer / 769–1024 200px / >1024 240px；一个 sidebarCollapsed 状态机。\nNew Instance 从 tabs 滚动序列移出；#tabs-container 独立横滚、min-width:0；桌面不启用 scroll-snap。\n#header 仍是 #main 内顶栏，不提升为压住侧栏的全宽顶栏。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0007",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 374,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "03 · 状态化动作（同一 DOM / 同一 model）",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0008",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 402,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "running / unhealthy / starting：仅 Stop；starting 的 Stop = 取消启动。stopping：无按钮，仅 Stopping…。\nstopped / failed / exited：仅 Restart + Delete，所有宽度直接内联；无活动实例或未知状态：无破坏性动作。\n不引入 More / overflow / menu；≤1024px 图标保留原 aria-label/title。完整状态矩阵见同稿 d1_action_states / desktop-action-states.png。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0009",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 516,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "04 · coarse 顶栏真实预算",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0010",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 544,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "coarse 顶栏 52px，控件真实 44×44 CSS px；移除 top:3px 透明溢出补丁。\n320px stopped 预算：320 −16 header padding −44 开关 −44 新建 −92 两动作 −12 外层 gap = 112px tabs。\n#instance-actions gap 4px；+ 与动作组不收缩，图标按钮 flex:0 0 44px。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0011",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 658,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "05 · worktree 动作行与密度",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0012",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 686,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": ".wt-row-actions 是唯一外层；fine 不换行，coarse 由 .wt-branch{flex-wrap:wrap} + 外层 flex:1 0 100% 形成独立行。\n200/240px 内容预算 172/212px；三动作 140px；长主仓库名 + GitHub 44px 的名称预算 122/162px。\nlocal/remote × active/inactive 条件渲染；空集合不生成外层。接受每动作项约 +44px，以滚动换可达性。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0013",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 822,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "06 · 评审与证据边界",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0014",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 850,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1120,
          "content": "评审重点：全宽度两动作内联、starting/stopping 差异、coarse 独立动作行、主仓库名称预算、Portal 单数据 DOM 与登录可达性。\npreview-responsive.html 只作交互预览；没有完整 VV / iPadOS 系统 UI，不能作为高度证据。\nv3.0 撤回 v2.2 的整页钉高：键盘浮在满高页面之上，被抬起的是终端宿主；根仍由 clip + 脱流 fixed 保证「滑不动」。\nv3.1 加三点：① 避让加 15% 比值地板（633.5 豁免，555 与满键盘让位）；② 状态栏 fixed 触物理底 + 侧栏分隔线 1px 穿 safe-area 到物理底；③ 滚轮只锁根默认、终端滚动归 xterm，不双滚不回顶。\nD0-1 完成 = 源稿 + PNG + preview 同版并通过评审；PR1/PR2 编码仍需评审签字。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
