          "content": "fine：名称独立一行，动作与 branch 同行；动作可见盒 = 命中盒，不向 workspace 透明溢出。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0625",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 530,
          "y": 590,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 360,
          "content": "coarse CSS 契约",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0626",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 530,
          "y": 622,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$info",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 400,
          "content": ".wt-branch { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.wt-row-actions {\n  flex: 1 0 100%;\n  margin-left: 0; min-width: 0;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n.wt-actions { display: contents; opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0627",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 970,
          "y": 590,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 420,
          "content": "动作集合矩阵",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0628",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 970,
          "y": 622,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 420,
          "content": "local regular inactive → Terminal + Finder（92px）\nlocal regular active → Terminal + Finder + Delete（140px）\nlocal main active/inactive → Terminal + Finder；无 Delete\nremote main active/inactive → 空集合；无 Delete、无外层\nremote regular inactive → 空集合，不渲染外层\nremote regular active → 仅 Delete（44px）\nGitHub 若存在只在名称行，不计入动作数",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_0629",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 530,
          "y": 880,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$danger",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 850,
          "content": "接受后果：coarse 每个有动作项约 +44px 密度下降；以 #wt-list 滚动保证末项与 Staged/Unstaged 可达。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        }
      ]
    },
