    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "d1_viewport_geometry",
      "x": 5040,
      "y": 2540,
      "name": "viewport-geometry",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 1240,
      "fill": "$bg-root",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_1201",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 20,
          "name": "标题",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1392,
          "content": "iPadOS 几何标注 v3.1 · 满高壳 + 15% 比值地板的 PTY 局部避让（键盘让位 / 薄浮窗豁免 / Home Indicator）",
          "lineHeight": 1.35,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_1202",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 50,
          "name": "说明",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1392,
          "content": "设计语义示意，不是真机测量证据。壳不动：scale = 1 时 raw = clientHeight − vv.height；raw < clientHeight × SMALL_OCCLUSION_RATIO(0.15) 则 occlusion = 0（豁免），达到才 occlusion = raw，并写进终端自己的三个 bottom（宿主 / 控制列 20+occlusion / 状态栏）；scale ≠ 1 是 zoom 豁免。不滚来自结构：html/body overflow = clip、#app computed fixed、根 scrollHeight ≤ clientHeight；滚轮只 preventDefault 根默认，绝不 scrollLines。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "id": "d1_rect_1203",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
