        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_1210",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 354,
          "y": 172,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 310,
          "content": "壳不变量（每个键盘态）：\napp.bottom = clientHeight，\ninline height 恒为空；\nraw < 15% → occlusion = 0，\n达到 15% → occlusion = raw；\n宿主 bottom = occlusion，\n控制列 = 20 + occlusion，\n状态栏 fixed = occlusion；不滚。\n分隔线 1px 穿 safe-area 触底。\n702 地板 105.3：555 让位 147。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d1_text_1211",
          "layoutPosition": "absolute",
          "x": 354,
          "y": 372,
          "name": "文本",
          "fill": "$info",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 310,
          "content": "workspace/host flex:min-height:0 → RO → fit → sendResize → appliedTTYSize；亚行余量仅显示主题色。\n避让只写终端三个 bottom：宿主 / 控制列 20+occlusion / 状态栏；#app 与根永不被写。\n滚轮隔离：只 preventDefault 根默认，终端滚动归 xterm，不双滚不回顶。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
