          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 310,
          "content": "真浮窗是纯覆盖层：hint 帧 vv.height =\ninnerHeight = clientHeight = 702 →\nocclusion = 0 是算式的结果，\n不是为它开的特例，也不猜成因。\nv3.1 地板 = 702 × 0.15 = 105.3\n633.5 → raw 68.5 = 9.8% 豁免 0\n555 → raw 147 = 20.9% ≥ 地板 → 让位\n宿主贴底 682，薄浮窗盖满高终端。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
